ere runs 75 years back to 1951. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that middle saw January to February at 31% and July to August at 154%. Grid 27766 had its driest year in 1963 at 60%.</p>"}
